-- ============================================================================
-- 20260812132900_seed_canonical_manifest_exercises.sql
-- ============================================================================
-- Seeds the 396 canonical first-party Yeti exercises defined in the provenance
-- manifest (scripts/data/yeti_exercise_provenance.json) if not already present.
--
-- This guarantees that fresh installations (staging, preview branches, CI)
-- satisfy the pre-flight check in 20260812133000_exercise_source_taxonomy_reconciliation.sql
-- without requiring manual out-of-band data imports.
--
-- Handles existing legacy seed rows by ensuring matching names carry canonical slugs,
-- and inserts missing canonical exercises safely.
-- ============================================================================

